VAD - Voice Activity Detector

Usage:
   vad [options] -i <input-wav> -o <output-vad> [-w <output-wav>]
   vad (-h | --help)
   vad --version

Options:
   -i FILE, --input-wav=FILE   WAVE file for voice activity detection
   -o FILE, --output-vad=FILE  Label file with the result of VAD
   -w FILE, --output-wav=FILE  WAVE file with silences cleared
   -1 REAL, --alfa1=REAL       Margen en dB sobre k0 para el umbral k1 [default: 4]
   -2 REAL, --alfa2=REAL       Margen en dB sobre k1 para el umbral k2 [default: 6]
   -s INT, --min-silence=INT   Tramas minimas para confirmar silencio [default: 12]
   -m INT, --min-voice=INT     Tramas maximas en maybe voice [default: 15]
   -n INT, --n-init=INT        Tramas iniciales para calcular k0 [default: 10]
   -v, --verbose  Show debug information
   -h, --help     Show this screen
   --version      Show the version of the project
